---
import SiteLayout from '@/layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---

<SiteLayout title="Privacy Policy | Tau Studio" description="Privacy policy and personal data processing of Tau Studio." locale="en">
  <main id="main" tabindex="-1" class="content legal-page">
    <section class="legal-page__intro" aria-labelledby="privacy-title">
      <p class="legal-page__eyebrow"><span></span> Legal</p>
      <h1 id="privacy-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="legal-page__lead">Information about the processing of personal data under GDPR and Spanish LOPDGDD.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-page__content">
      <h2>1. Data controller</h2>
      <p><strong>Name:</strong> Paul Guillamón (Tau Studio)</p>
      <p><strong>Location:</strong> Almería, Spain</p>
      <p><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:hey@tau.studio">hey@tau.studio</a></p>

      <h2>2. Data we collect</h2>
      <p>Through the contact form we collect: name, email, phone (optional), service of interest and message. We also collect basic technical data necessary for the operation of the site.</p>

      <h2>3. Purpose and legal basis</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Reply to enquiries and information requests (legal basis: user consent).</li>
        <li>Provide requested services and manage the pre-contractual relationship (legal basis: pre-contractual measures).</li>
        <li>Improve the website through anonymous analytics (legal basis: legitimate interest, without tracking cookies).</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>4. Retention</h2>
      <p>Data is kept for as long as necessary for the stated purpose and, in any case, for the applicable legal periods. You may request deletion at any time.</p>

      <h2>5. Recipients</h2>
      <p>Data is hosted on third-party services necessary for the operation of the site: Netlify (hosting and forms) and the Umami analytics service (without tracking cookies). Data is not shared with other third parties except as required by law.</p>

      <h2>6. Your rights</h2>
      <p>You may exercise your rights of access, rectification, erasure, objection, restriction and portability by writing to <a href="mailto:hey@tau.studio">hey@tau.studio</a>. You may also lodge a complaint with the Spanish Data Protection Agency (AEPD).</p>

      <h2>7. Cookies</h2>
      <p>This site does not use tracking or advertising cookies. Analytics is performed anonymously and without cookies. You can configure your browser to block any local storage.</p>

      <p class="legal-page__updated">Last updated: 27 October 2026.</p>
    </section>
  </main>
</SiteLayout>
